# Build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor, IDE, and AI/agent tooling state.
#
# These are per-developer settings, not project configuration. They were
# previously covered only by individual developers' global git config, which
# left a fresh clone free to commit them.
#
# Shared project config lives at the repo root and is tracked deliberately:
# AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .cargo/config.toml, deny.toml, rust-toolchain.toml.
# To share something from an ignored directory, add a negation below rather
# than relying on `git add -f`, so the decision is visible in the diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# AI / agent tooling
.claude/
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules
.windsurf/
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.github/copilot-instructions.local.md

# IDEs and editors
.idea/
.vscode/
.zed/
.fleet/
.helix/
*.iml
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.sublime-project
.sublime-workspace

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
